 {"op":"add_para","n":11,"part":"sol","after":"{atno} (1) ⟦132⟧","text":"(1) ⟦x+y=6⟧, ⟦xy=(3+ sqrt {2} )(3- sqrt {2} )=7⟧이므로⏎⟦x ^{3} +xy ^{2} +x ^{2} y+y ^{3} =x ^{2} (x+y)+y ^{2} (x+y)⟧⏎⟦=(x+y)(x ^{2} +y ^{2} )=(x+y) left{ (x+y) ^{2} -2xy right}⟧⏎⟦=6 TIMES (36-14)=132⟧"},
 {"op":"add_para","n":11,"part":"sol","after":"=132⟧","text":"(2) ⟦20=n⟧이라 하면⏎⟦n(n+1)(n+2)(n+3)+1= left{ n(n+3) right} left{ (n+1)(n+2) right} +1⟧⏎⟦=(n ^{2} +3n)(n ^{2} +3n+2)+1=(n ^{2} +3n+1) ^{2}⟧⏎이므로 ⟦sqrt {20 TIMES 21 TIMES 22 TIMES 23+1} =20 ^{2} +3 TIMES 20+1=461⟧"},
