 {"op":"add_para","n":12,"part":"sol","after":"=160⟧","text":"(2) ⟦10=n⟧이라 하면⏎⟦n(n+1)(n+2)(n+3)+1= left{ n(n+3) right} left{ (n+1)(n+2) right} +1⟧⏎⟦=(n ^{2} +3n)(n ^{2} +3n+2)+1=(n ^{2} +3n+1) ^{2}⟧⏎이므로 ⟦sqrt {10 TIMES 11 TIMES 12 TIMES 13+1} =10 ^{2} +3 TIMES 10+1=131⟧"},
